flowchart TD
  accTitle: Read Story shape and guarded Alpha promotion after merges 141 and 142
  accDescr: PR 141 applies the standard rounded control shape to Read Story. PR 142 verifies an Internal version, then promotes it to Alpha only after an exact review-replacement acknowledgement and verifies Alpha afterward.

  subgraph Feed[PR 141: Home feed Read Story]
    dimensions[Theme control corner radius] --> shape[One rounded control shape]
    shape --> shadow[Shadow]
    shape --> clip[Clip]
    shape --> border[Border]
    shape --> test[Geometry regression test: 16 dp corner, less than half of 48 dp height]
  end

  subgraph Promotion[PR 142: Guarded Play Alpha promotion]
    start[Manual workflow on main] --> acknowledgement{Exact REPLACE_ALPHA_REVIEW acknowledgement?}
    acknowledgement -->|no| stop[Stop]
    acknowledgement -->|yes| internal[Verify requested version on Internal]
    internal --> alpha[Query Alpha]
    alpha --> present{Version already on Alpha?}
    present -->|yes| already[Report already-present]
    present -->|no| newer{Version code greater than Alpha maximum?}
    newer -->|no| stop
    newer -->|yes| promote[Assign verified bundle to Alpha completed rollout]
    promote --> commit[Commit with CANCEL_IN_REVIEW_AND_SUBMIT]
    commit --> verify[Query Alpha again for requested version]
  end
